{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t保安局局長鄧炳強表示，皇崗口岸午後起出入境人流明顯上升，現場正加強管理同優化指示。他促請市民及旅客遵從現場人員指示，有序分流使用傳統櫃位或自助閘機。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n鄧炳強在社交專頁說，建議市民預先透過「e-道」App登記，以更快捷過關。為避免輪候時間較長，應預早規劃行程，盡量避開繁忙時段過關。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:39:30.087299+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:26:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T09:37:42.102382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:37:34.101087+00:00","content_hash":"0be893fa9072bef421a1150707c66dff67b7488b78132f7acc7fb62c3fb901d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}